    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787980/extras/b0fff2525afa22824fff800a67db1744.avif?t=1749878278\" width=615 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>top-down shooter</strong> with action packed <strong>PvP</strong> combat.\u00a0 Engage in <strong>FFA</strong> or <strong>team based</strong> combat with game modes like capture the flag, control points, or team deathmatch.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787980/extras/0847817fab91e59397e3a1c1f191d7f9.avif?t=1749878278\" width=615 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in a full on free for all quest for the highest score and the most kills.\u00a0 But you can also play on maps with 2, 3 or 4 teams with different team based objects.\u00a0 Capture all other teams flags and bring them back to your base.\u00a0 Control all the points on the map.\u00a0 Or engage in good old fashion team death match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787980/extras/1f9925b3d21fb4fe701e23e004ea0029.avif?t=1749878278\" width=615 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to sit up straight and use your keyboard to get competitive.\u00a0 Gridfire gameplay compatible with controller based input.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787980/extras/7d377e2eddf79772b21c36a39c0b80f2.avif?t=1749878278\" width=615 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure you don't just fly directly into the line of fire.\u00a0 Gridfire is all about strategy.\u00a0 Use a variety of weapons to force enemies to move out from under cover.\u00a0 Take advantage of strategically superior positions on the map.\u00a0 Some walls only allow fire through them in one direction.\u00a0 Other parts of the map will speed you up in certain directions or slow you down in others.\u00a0 If you play with teammates, you'll have to coordinate attacks to achieve your goals.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787980/extras/b0fff2525afa22824fff800a67db1744.avif?t=1749878278\" width=615 height=644 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>top-down shooter</strong> with action packed <strong>PvP</strong> combat.\u00a0 Engage in <strong>FFA</strong> or <strong>team based</strong> combat with game modes like capture the flag, control points, or team deathmatch.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787980/extras/0847817fab91e59397e3a1c1f191d7f9.avif?t=1749878278\" width=615 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play in a full on free for all quest for the highest score and the most kills.\u00a0 But you can also play on maps with 2, 3 or 4 teams with different team based objects.\u00a0 Capture all other teams flags and bring them back to your base.\u00a0 Control all the points on the map.\u00a0 Or engage in good old fashion team death match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787980/extras/1f9925b3d21fb4fe701e23e004ea0029.avif?t=1749878278\" width=615 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't have to sit up straight and use your keyboard to get competitive.\u00a0 Gridfire gameplay compatible with controller based input.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787980/extras/7d377e2eddf79772b21c36a39c0b80f2.avif?t=1749878278\" width=615 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure you don't just fly directly into the line of fire.\u00a0 Gridfire is all about strategy.\u00a0 Use a variety of weapons to force enemies to move out from under cover.\u00a0 Take advantage of strategically superior positions on the map.\u00a0 Some walls only allow fire through them in one direction.\u00a0 Other parts of the map will speed you up in certain directions or slow you down in others.\u00a0 If you play with teammates, you'll have to coordinate attacks to achieve your goals.</p>",
